        "quote": "若乏力越来越重、头晕欲晕、心慌气促或出血增多，应及时就医"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00213",
        "explanation": "The trajectory ended after the caregiver asked an additional same-night execution question.",
        "quote": "今晚还需要额外做什么吗？"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The medication, pathology, stool-result, and gynecology follow-up plan was largely executable and traceable, but closure was not fully safe because the required urinary red-flag warning was never included, and the last caregiver question was not answered.",
